                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Payers handed in by Lord
                    Lyons.—Chesapeake.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[List of Papers.]</seg></opener>
                <p>1. Memorial of Susan Henry.</p>
                <p>2. Affidavit of John E. Holt.</p>
                <p>3. Memorial of John E. Holt.</p>
                <p>4. Affidavit of John E. Holt.</p>
                <p>5. Provincial secretary to mayor of Halifax, December 19, 1863.</p>
                <p>6. Mayor of Halifax to provincial secretary, December 19, 1863.</p>
                <p>7. Same to same, December 22, 1863.</p>
                <p>8. City marshal to mayor of Halifax, December 21, 1863.</p>
                <p>9. Police Constable Hutt to city marshal, December 21, 1863.</p>











